-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.94<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 31, 2016<br/>Summer Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20160425192050&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Void_Boots_c95f47.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  void boots <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:2, speed +30, faster regeneration, protection energy +10%)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 150 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 15.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Look like <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Void Boots (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Void_Boots_Red_2da6ff.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> when used. Increases your Mana and Hitpoints Regeneration for 60 minutes (1 hour) by the rate of 3 HP and 12 MP per 6 seconds, for a total of 7200 MP and 1800 HP. Void Boots cannot be repaired and will disappear after use. As they have the same regeneration bonus as <a href=\"#/wiki/Pair%20of%20Soft%20Boots\">Soft Boots</a>, the Void Boots are a better alternative while hunting due to armor and speed bonuses. If they cost less than 2500 gold on your game world, they are even cheaper than <a href=\"#/wiki/Pair%20of%20Soft%20Boots\">Soft Boots</a> to use.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Anomaly\">Anomaly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eradicator\">Eradicator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Outburst\">Outburst</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Realityquake\">Realityquake</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rupture\">Rupture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Scourge%20of%20Oblivion\">The Scourge of Oblivion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Devourer\">World Devourer</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw